                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Where does ML deliver the highest ROI?</h3>
                                        <p>Demand forecasting, churn prediction, fraud detection, and dynamic pricing consistently deliver the highest measurable ROI in enterprise settings.</p>
                                        <h3>Do I need a data science team to deploy ML?</h3>
                                        <p>For off-shelf integrations, no. For custom builds, yes — you need at least one senior data scientist / ML engineer, ideally with an ops-focused partner for platform + MLOps.</p>
                                        <h3>How long before ML models produce ROI?</h3>
                                        <p>Well-scoped use cases with clean data: 3-6 months. Poorly scoped or data-limited: often never.</p>
                                        <h3>Isn't gen AI making classical ML obsolete?</h3>
                                        <p>No. For structured / tabular business problems (forecasting, scoring, ranking), classical ML still outperforms LLMs on cost, latency, and accuracy.</p>
